      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tks for posting this.\n\nI was experiencing random VRChat crashes with no error at all. I went through drivers, graphics settings, VRChat configs, and even reinstalled and formatted my entire PC, still with no success. Discord was honestly the last thing I would have suspected.\n\nAfter finding this post and adjusting the Discord settings mentioned here, the crashes completely stopped and I was finally able to play normally again.\n\nReally appreciate you sharing this! it saved me from continuing to troubleshoot in the wrong direction.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
